# Cinema Summary Poster API Configuration / API 配置
# ⚠️ DO NOT commit this file to version control!
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your real key.
# ⚠️ 请勿将此文件提交至版本控制系统！
# 复制此文件为 .env 并填入真实密钥。
#
# ℹ️ This file is OPTIONAL since v1.4.
# Mode A (Return Prompt) works with NO key at all.
# This key is for the DEVELOPER'S OWN TESTING ONLY.
# It must NEVER be used to generate images on behalf of users.
# ℹ️ 自 v1.4 起本文件为可选项。
# 模式 A（返回 Prompt）无需任何 Key 即可使用。
# 此 Key 仅供开发者自测，绝不用于替用户生图。

# API Key for image generation service (dev self-test only)
# Get yours at: https://example.com/api-keys
# Rotation cycle: Every 30 days or immediately upon suspected leak
# Quota setting: Recommended to set daily/monthly limits in provider dashboard
# API 密钥获取地址：https://example.com/api-keys
# 轮换周期：每 30 天或怀疑泄露时立即更换
# 限额设置：建议在服务商后台设置每日/每月调用上限
CINEMA_POSTER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Optional: Custom model endpoint (leave empty to use default)
# 可选：自定义模型端点（留空则使用默认值）
# CINEMA_POSTER_MODEL_ENDPOINT=

# Optional: Request timeout in seconds (default: 60)
# 可选：请求超时时间（秒），默认 60
# CINEMA_POSTER_TIMEOUT=60
